    "The camera": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台相机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera color mode selects D-Log, D-Log2, D-Log M, Rec.709, or HLG automatically. CineStop paints five stops around 18% gray, read through the camera's log curve: dark green −2, yellow-green −1, gray at 18%, light pink +1 (skin), soft yellow +2 (upper skin limit). Red is clipped and violet is crushed; other shadows are flat dark gray and other highlights flat light gray. Video paints video-level IRE stripes (green 41–48, pink 61–70, red clip) over luminance grayscale. IRE paints six video-level zones over luminance grayscale: purple crush, blue near-black, green 18% gray, pink one stop over, yellow near clip, red clip. On log, Video and IRE read the camera's Rec.709 look (709) or the raw signal (LOG), set under Read. Limits paints only shadow and highlight warnings, leaving other colors untouched. D-Log M uses a direct 0–100 signal scale. Its gray guide and CineStop stops are Pocket 3 estimates, not calibrated sensor limits. Use IRE for signal measurements on other D-Log M cameras.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera color mode selects D-Log, D-Log2, D-Log M, Rec.709, or HLG automatically. CineStop paints five stops around 18% gray, read through the camera's log curve: dark green −2, yellow-green −1, gray at 18%, light pink +1 (skin), soft yellow +2 (upper skin limit). Red is clipped and violet is crushed; other shadows are flat dark gray and other highlights flat light gray. Video paints video-level IRE stripes (green 41–48, pink 61–70, red clip) over luminance grayscale. IRE paints six video-level zones over luminance grayscale: purple crush, blue near-black, green 18% gray, pink one stop over, yellow near clip, red clip. On log, Video and IRE read the camera's Rec.709 look (709) or the raw signal (LOG), set under Read. Limits paints only shadow and highlight warnings, leaving other colors untouched. D-Log M uses a direct 0–100 signal scale. Its gray guide and CineStop stops are Pocket 3 estimates, not calibrated sensor limits. Use IRE for signal measurements on other D-Log M cameras."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机色彩模式会自动选 D-Log、D-Log2、D-Log M、Rec.709 或 HLG。CineStop 以 18% 灰为中心画五个档位，按相机的 Log 曲线读取：深绿 −2、黄绿 −1、灰色为 18%、浅粉 +1（肤色）、淡黄 +2（肤色上限）。红色是过曝削波，紫色是死黑；其余暗部是平的深灰，其余亮部是平的浅灰。Video 在亮度灰阶上画视频电平 IRE 条带（绿 41–48、粉 61–70、红削波）。IRE 在亮度灰阶上画六个视频电平分区：紫死黑、蓝近黑、绿 18% 灰、粉高一档、黄近削波、红削波。在 Log 下，Video 和 IRE 读的是相机的 Rec.709 风格（709）或原始信号（LOG），在 Read（读取）里设置。Limits 只画暗部和亮部警告，其余颜色不动。D-Log M 用 0–100 的直接信号刻度，它的灰阶指引和 CineStop 档位是 Pocket 3 的估算值，不是标定过的传感器极限。在其他 D-Log M 机型上测信号请用 IRE。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera could not find this iPhone’s hotspot. Turn on Personal Hotspot and Allow Others to Join, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera could not find this iPhone’s hotspot. Turn on Personal Hotspot and Allow Others to Join, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机找不到这台 iPhone 的热点。请打开个人热点并允许其他人加入，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera did not answer over its Wi-Fi. Turn off DJI Frame Tap and force quit DJI Mimo on every phone near the camera, pause any VPN or ad blocker, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The camera did not answer over its Wi-Fi. Turn off DJI Frame Tap and force quit DJI Mimo on every phone near the camera, pause any VPN or ad blocker, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机在它的 Wi-Fi 上没有回应。请把相机附近每台手机上的 DJI Frame Tap 都关掉、DJI Mimo 都彻底退出，再暂停 VPN 或广告拦截工具，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera did not confirm recording. Check its screen before trying again.": {
