            "value": "Zoom locked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "变焦已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "camera still in a Mimo session — quit Mimo, power-cycle the camera, then tap once": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "camera still in a Mimo session — quit Mimo, power-cycle the camera, then tap once"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机还处在 Mimo 会话里——请退出 Mimo，给相机断电重启，再点一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "couldn't read the camera's Wi-Fi credentials": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "couldn't read the camera's Wi-Fi credentials"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没能读到相机的 Wi-Fi 账号密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone is still on the other camera's Wi-Fi (Pocket and Nano both use 192.168.2.1). Forget that network in Settings → Wi-Fi, then tap Connect. The other camera can stay on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone is still on the other camera's Wi-Fi (Pocket and Nano both use 192.168.2.1). Forget that network in Settings → Wi-Fi, then tap Connect. The other camera can stay on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 还连在另一台相机的 Wi-Fi 上（Pocket 和 Nano 都用 192.168.2.1）。请在设置 → Wi-Fi 里忽略那个网络，再点连接。另一台相机可以保持开机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not live": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "not live"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不在实时状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pairing timed out — tap Approve on the camera if it asked": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pairing timed out — tap Approve on the camera if it asked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对超时了——如果相机有提示，请在相机上点 Approve（确认）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the Nano did not confirm its Wi-Fi wake. Keep it powered on and try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the Nano did not confirm its Wi-Fi wake. Keep it powered on and try again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nano 没有确认它的 Wi-Fi 唤醒。请保持开机，再试一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the camera disconnected": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the camera disconnected"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机断开了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the camera disconnected while reading %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the camera disconnected while reading %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取 %@ 时相机断开了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the camera joined the Wi-Fi, but this iPhone cannot reach it there. The router is keeping the two apart: on a Wi-Fi 7 router turn off MLO for this network (or add a camera network without it), and turn off client isolation. The Hotspot setup avoids the router": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the camera joined the Wi-Fi, but this iPhone cannot reach it there. The router is keeping the two apart: on a Wi-Fi 7 router turn off MLO for this network (or add a camera network without it), and turn off client isolation. The Hotspot setup avoids the router"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机已经加入了 Wi-Fi，但这台 iPhone 在这个网络里够不着它，是路由器把两者隔开了：在 Wi-Fi 7 路由器上给这个网络关掉 MLO（或者另外加一个不带 MLO 的相机网络），并关掉客户端隔离。用热点设置可以绕开路由器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the camera stopped responding": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the camera stopped responding"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机没有回应了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this iPhone could not join the Wi-Fi. Check the password and that the network is in range": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "this iPhone could not join the Wi-Fi. Check the password and that the network is in range"
