        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 没能加入 Wi-Fi。请检查密码，并确认网络在信号范围内"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this setup's password is missing on this device. Edit the setup and enter it again": {
